// PHYSICS_WORLD: with Physics Settle on, the stones are simulated in world space, so the Bounds Transform is applied to the points here
// (Scale was already applied about the Pivot by the variation stage) and the USD transform of the PointInstancer stays identity.
// Same order as the Xform LOP: scale, then rotate about the Pivot, then Position.
vector pivot = chv("../../bound_p");
vector4 q = eulertoquaternion(radians(chv("../../bound_r")), XFORM_XYZ);
@P = pivot + qrotate(q, @P - pivot) + chv("../../bound_t");
p@orient = qmultiply(q, p@orient);
